        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Avakian, Bobby Managoff, Louis Armstrong, Miles Davis\n- Companies: Columbia Records\n- Organizations: National Wrestling Alliance\n- Roles: record producer, executive, professional wrestler\n- Topics: jazz, Armenian descent\n\nFacts:\n- Bobby Managoff, born Robert Manoogian Jr., was born on January 4, 1918.\n- George Avakian was born on March 15, 1919.\n- George Avakian is an American record producer and executive known particularly for his work with Columbia Records.\n- George Avakian produced albums by jazz musicians including Louis Armstrong and Miles Davis.\n- Bobby Managoff was an American professional wrestler of Armenian descent best known for his work with the National Wrestling Alliance in the 1940s.\n- Bobby Managoff died on April 3, 2002.",
